; The videoprt.sys exports hvfb uses, for an import library on NT 5.2 x64
; (mingw-w64 ships no libvideoprt.a for x86_64). x64 names are undecorated.
LIBRARY videoprt.sys
EXPORTS
VideoPortDebugPrint
VideoPortFreeDeviceBase
VideoPortGetDeviceBase
VideoPortInitialize
VideoPortMapMemory
VideoPortQueryServices
VideoPortSetRegistryParameters
VideoPortUnmapMemory
VideoPortZeroDeviceMemory
VideoPortZeroMemory
